4uQG_8R4AIVvuD8kYmma4u1qXjVKxk3urCJAo6sVTCGmizftf31a9Fn2vtPCbc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPN-qKjodZI0pnUqlZrWAtEvj5SxX078y29bxW_FjWksg&oe=6AD22D57"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1158447621850397", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035353_1158447625183730_6458765565871963951_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JlnMPgcr2IAQ7kNvwGhIvCb&_nc_oc=AdqwjyvTNqjaRqZS-R7P3m0Cjg-rK_iHvJb2udmMk6wmLwMT89fLQ9vrLb9Pw1Y3rBM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPW8ImWMtNJRP3h14u1rHRUtdFt3Rddv2Rq5j-K8YVjTw&oe=6AD22B61"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "430710953030699", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982609_430710956364032_6150975977529824521_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1lQcCLKS_kEQ7kNvwFudo3m&_nc_oc=Adpno0vzWNKz2_hKX27RPuwfd9IJdSPzGbNocl5OJFcVXHAjdOIV1I0DuPtlus9iN94&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPczzePH4s1LABb4VUGOdzJFJfSq0ZRwBGHZynmOtOA0g&oe=6AD251D7"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "837774275033767", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982616_837774278367100_4897090437410338032_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nWNxG0jJ_5QQ7kNvwGgnC1P&_nc_oc=AdpplVU0ukqbnrPnmV9-E47xdUousvZJttnsurWs126TLb9fCs_TQs9-o7YXsSfZn8E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMMz8wYL3N1hmX3JqqyiXHffbRTQR4DRx665tL9VbEbfA&oe=6AD25862"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "land-2560x1440.png", "id": "801538871433377", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984470_801538874766710_7104644288614866285_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oyZSh88eBmwQ7kNvwF8QEha&_nc_oc=Ado3TU7N-oocFFr8Zln81Q7NA0BVwUpI1hjJ6s9uPAtlUS9Q6RHg_v2Vm7GMtuva-AA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMCfdWlY77w5pKQic3XqbIJ9gY589LeW6ywNyLVexEHdA&oe=6AD244AE"}, "display_name": "shadow", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Travel through a series of increasingly complex levels, each designed to test your ability to visualize and manipulate 3D structures in a VR environment. With intuitive controls, you can directly interact with the cube and tubes, manipulating them with precision to create clear paths that abide by the rules.\nShadow is not just a game; it's a brain-teasing journey that unfolds within a minimalist, visually stunning universe that evolves as you progress. Each successful connection not only brings satisfaction but also unlocks new levels and complexities. This game ensures that every solution is a burst of dopamine as you see your spatial reasoning skills visibly improve.\nImmersive VR Experience: Feel the thrill of manipulating complex 3D puzzles in a fully immersive VR environment.\nChallenging Gameplay: Master the art of connecting points without intersection, crafting a continuous path through various angles and perspectives.\nProgressive Difficulty: As you advance, the puzzles increase in complexity, offering endless hours of engaging gameplay.\nEducational and Fun: Perfect for puzzle enthusiasts and those looking to sharpen their spatial thinking and geometry skills.\n\nPrepare to stretch your mind and enjoy a unique blend of puzzle-solving and construction in Shadow, where every level is a new opportunity to prove your ingenious problem-solving prowess in the virtual world!", "short_description": "Embark on a mesmerizing puzzle adventure in the virtual world of Shadow, where logic and creativity intertwine. Dive into an immersive experience where you must connect the vertices of a seemingly simple cube using tubes based on orthographic projections. But there's a twist\u2014ensure the tubes do not intersect and remain continuous, challenging your spatial awareness and problem-solving skills."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://digitalsolutions.mn/policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null